OL,3,GNEWSAFrom banshees to the big screen:
OL,4,AIreland's unique approach to horror
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a "nation of storytellers" what
OL,7,Fseparates the way we tell stories of
OL,8,Fhorror and folklore, making it
OL,9,Fquintessential to where we are from?
OL,11,FThe answer to that question could lie
OL,12,Fat this year's Belfast International
OL,13,FHorror Festival, which is in its
OL,14,Fseventh year.
OL,16,FHaving kicked off on Wednesday, running
OL,17,Funtil Sunday, this year's event will
OL,18,Fshowcase six horror movies across four
OL,19,Fvenues in the city.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
