OL,3,GNEWSAFrom banshees to the big screen:
OL,4,AIreland's unique approach to horror
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith Hollywood favourites on offer,
OL,7,Fthere is also a rich vein of local
OL,8,Ftalent competing in the festival's
OL,9,Fshort film competition, with their own
OL,10,Funique take on the genre.
